iga-surface-bending-curve.out
Bending IGA curve in plane strain: the independent energy derivative of its extrusion
StaticStructural nsteps 1 deltat 1.0 rtolv 1.e-11 maxiter 10 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dPlaneStress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all
ndofman 4 nelem 1 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 4 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 4
# A quadratic two-span curve (C1) with bending, all displacements prescribed. Its reactions are the sums over
# the rows of the reactions of the extruded surface (iga-surface3d-bending-extruded.in) divided by the length 0.8,
# i.e. the derivative of the energy per unit length below.
# Reference values: the derivative (complex step) of the total energy integrated with the same Gauss rule
# (4 points per span and direction) from the classical surface quantities, independently of the grad F
# formulation of OOFEM: metrics A_ab, a_ab, J = sqrt(det a / det A), |F|^2 = A^ab a_ab, n = x_,1 x x_,2 / |.|,
# H = a^ab (n . x_,ab) / 2, W = .4 J + .2 |F| + .5 (|F|^2/2 - 1 - ln J) + .6 (ln J)^2/2 + .3 (J - 1)^2/2
# + .7/2 J (H - h0)^2 with h0 = 0.3 (useh0 2: its sign follows the normal, the same for the curve and the
# surface, n = (t_y, -t_x, 0) for the tangent t along the curve).
node 1 coords 2 0.0 0.0
node 2 coords 2 0.3 0.4
node 3 coords 2 0.7 0.5
node 4 coords 2 1.0 0.2
bsplineplanestrainsurfaceelement 1 nodes 4 1 2 3 4 crosssect 1 knotvectoru 3 0 0.5 1 degree 1 2 nip 4 nlgeo 1
simplesurfacecs 1 material 1
surfacetensionmat2 1 gamma1 0.4 alpha1 0.2 mu 0.5 lambda 0.6 alphas 0.3 omega1 0.7 useh0 2 h0 0.3 d 1.0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0.0 0.0 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0.03 0.05 set 2
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 -0.02 0.08 set 3
BoundaryCondition 4 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0.06 -0.04 set 4
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
Set 1 nodes 1 1
Set 2 nodes 1 2
Set 3 nodes 1 3
Set 4 nodes 1 4
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-9
#REACTION tStep 1 number 1 dof 1 value -0.22390794091572636
#REACTION tStep 1 number 1 dof 2 value -0.8336602346480066
#REACTION tStep 1 number 2 dof 1 value 2.0645490587465716
#REACTION tStep 1 number 2 dof 2 value 0.3685226896317322
#REACTION tStep 1 number 3 dof 1 value -1.9848574793318174
#REACTION tStep 1 number 3 dof 2 value 2.1414577079791144
#REACTION tStep 1 number 4 dof 1 value 0.14421636150097122
#REACTION tStep 1 number 4 dof 2 value -1.6763201629628393
#%END_CHECK%
